     username _u_s_e_r.  The uulloogg__llooggiinn__ppsseeuuddoo() function uses file descriptor to
     a pseudo-terminal master device _f_d to determine the TTY name, while using
     the username belonging to the real user ID of the calling process.  The
     optional _h_o_s_t argument denotes a remote hostname, in case the login ses‐
     sion is provided by a network service.

     The uulloogg__llooggoouutt() and uulloogg__llooggoouutt__ppsseeuuddoo() functions mark the previously
